<main id="main">
<section class="ihero"><div class="ihero-text"><div class="ihero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/appraisal-tools/">Tools</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">›</span><span aria-current="page">Appraisal Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</span></nav><p class="kicker">Free calculator</p><h1>Appraisal Cost Calculator: Claim Gap and Fee Estimator</h1><p class="lede">Enter both estimates, choose where an award might land and add realistic costs, including travel for remote Alaska properties. The estimator shows whether appraisal is likely to leave you ahead.</p></div></div><figure class="ihero-photo"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-documents.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-documents-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-documents.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:900px) 100vw, 55vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></figure></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="rv-off">
<div class="calc" data-tool="gap">
  <div class="calc-bar"><span>Appraisal gap &amp; fee estimator</span><em>Runs in your browser · nothing saved</em></div>
  <div class="calc-grid">
    <div class="calc-in">
      <div class="pair">
        <div><label for="g-ins">Insurer's estimate (RCV)</label><input id="g-ins" name="insurer" inputmode="decimal" value="22600"><span class="hint">Replacement cost total on the carrier's estimate.</span></div>
        <div><label for="g-own">Your estimate (RCV)</label><input id="g-own" name="yours" inputmode="decimal" value="38900"><span class="hint">From your contractor or an independent estimate.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div><label for="g-land">Where might the award land within the gap?</label>
        <div class="range"><input id="g-land" type="range" name="land" min="0" max="100" step="5" value="55" data-unit="%"><output>55%</output></div>
        <span class="hint">0% means the carrier's number holds; 100% means your full number is awarded.</span></div>
      <div class="pair">
        <div><label for="g-ft">Your appraiser's fee type</label><select id="g-ft" name="feetype"><option value="flat">Flat fee ($)</option><option value="pct">Percent of the increase (%)</option></select></div>
        <div><label for="g-fee">Fee amount</label><input id="g-fee" name="fee" inputmode="decimal" value="3000"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pair">
        <div><label for="g-trav">Inspection travel for remote sites ($)</label><input id="g-trav" name="travel" inputmode="decimal" value="0"><span class="hint">Airfare, boat or lodging for off-road-system properties.</span></div>
        <div><label for="g-ump">Umpire's total fee ($)</label><input id="g-ump" name="umpire" inputmode="decimal" value="3500"><span class="hint">Usually split 50/50.</span></div>
      </div>
      <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="useump" checked> Include my half of an umpire's fee</label>
    </div>
    <div class="calc-out" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="big"><small>Estimated net increase to you</small><b data-o="net">$0</b></div>
      <div class="stack" aria-hidden="true"><span class="s1"></span><span class="s2"></span><span class="s3"></span></div>
      <div class="legend"><span><i class="s1"></i>Carrier's number</span><span><i class="s2"></i>Your net gain</span><span><i class="s3"></i>Appraisal costs</span></div>
      <dl class="rows">
        <div><dt>Amount in dispute</dt><dd data-o="gap">$0</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Gap as % of carrier estimate</dt><dd data-o="pct">—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Projected award (RCV)</dt><dd data-o="award">$0</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Gross increase</dt><dd data-o="gain">$0</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Your appraisal costs</dt><dd data-o="cost">$0</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p class="msg" data-o="msg"></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div><p class="hint center">For planning only. Results depend on what you enter and on your policy, and are not a quote, an appraisal or legal advice.</p><noscript><p class="note">This calculator needs JavaScript. You can still call us at (844) 537-1427 and we’ll run the numbers with you.</p></noscript></div></section>
<div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose">
<h2>How to use the estimator</h2>
<ol><li><strong>Enter the insurer's RCV total</strong>, the replacement cost figure before depreciation and deductible.</li>
<li><strong>Enter your own estimate</strong> at RCV from a contractor or independent estimator.</li>
<li><strong>Move the slider</strong> to test outcomes. Try 30%, 50% and 80% to see a range, not a single answer.</li>
<li><strong>Add costs.</strong> Use your appraiser's quoted fee, a realistic umpire fee and any travel needed to reach the property.</li></ol>
<h2>The Alaska twist: travel</h2>
<p>For a home in Anchorage or Fairbanks, travel is a minor cost. For a lodge on a fly-in lake or a home in a western Alaska village, getting an appraiser on site can mean airfare, charter time and lodging. Including it here shows whether the gap still justifies appraisal once those costs are counted.</p>
<h2>Reading the result</h2>
<p>If the net increase only looks good at 90% or 100%, the case is fragile. If it still makes sense at 40%, appraisal is more likely to be worth discussing. All figures are illustrative and depend on what you enter.</p>
<h2>Questions about this tool</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Is the projected award a prediction?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>No. It is a planning scenario. Real awards depend on documentation, the panel and the policy.</p></div></details><details><summary>What does an umpire usually charge?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>It varies with the size and complexity of the claim. Ask for a quote once an umpire is proposed. The cost is usually split evenly.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free tools</h2><div class="rel-grid"><a class="rel" href="/appraisal-tools/depreciation-holdback-worksheet/"><small>Worksheet</small><span>RCV/ACV Depreciation Worksheet</span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="rel" href="/appraisal-tools/roof-area-pitch-calculator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Roof Area &amp; Pitch Calculator</span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="rel" href="/appraisal-tools/deductible-impact-calculator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Deductible Impact Calculator</span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article><aside class="side"><div class="side-stick"><div class="side-box call"><h2 class="side-h">Talk it through</h2><p>Free first conversation. We’ll tell you honestly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="side-phone" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn gold block" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Send claim details</a><small>Mon–Fri 8am–6pm Alaska Time</small></div><div class="side-box"><h2 class="side-h">All claim tools</h2><ul class="side-list"><li><a href="/appraisal-tools/appraisal-gap-fee-estimator/" aria-current="page">Appraisal Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-tools/depreciation-holdback-worksheet/">RCV/ACV Depreciation Worksheet</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-tools/roof-area-pitch-calculator/">Roof Area &amp; Pitch Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-tools/deductible-impact-calculator/">Deductible Impact Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-tools/claim-timeline-planner/">Claim Timeline Planner</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-tools/appraisal-file-checkup/">Appraisal File Checkup</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-tools/roof-snow-load-calculator/">Roof Snow Load Calculator</a></li></ul></div></div></aside></div><section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap cta-in rv"><div><p class="cta-h">Want a professional to check the numbers?</p><p>Send us your estimate and we’ll review it line by line.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line light" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
